  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bokk Doole Food Security Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to provide inputs and equipment for a garden; as well as construct a cereal bank and provide working capital to stock the cereal bank to help improve food security in the 12 villages of the organization. In addition training to build financial and organization management capacity will be provided to help the group to improve operations and become sustainable.</narrative>
  </description>
